# Maintainer: Yūrei Linux project
# Yūrei's own recipe (stage 3, the desktop; docs/INDEPENDENT.md). The source
# address and sum are the ones in independent/bootstrap/sources.lock;
# check-recipes.py keeps them the same.
pkgname=xcb-util-wm
pkgver=0.4.2
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc="XCB window manager helpers (ICCCM, EWMH), for Xwayland in wlroots"
arch=(x86_64)
url="https://www.x.org/"
license=(MIT)
depends=(libxcb)
source=("https://www.x.org/releases/individual/lib/xcb-util-wm-$pkgver.tar.xz")
sha256sums=('62c34e21d06264687faea7edbf63632c9f04d55e72114aa4a57bb95e4f888a0b')

build() {
    cd xcb-util-wm-$pkgver
    ./configure --prefix=/usr --sysconfdir=/etc --localstatedir=/var --disable-static
    make
}

package() {
    cd xcb-util-wm-$pkgver
    make DESTDIR="$pkgdir" install
}
